&lt;p&gt;Sources, accessed October 13, 2026: &lt;a href="https://github.com/Yunsoft-Software/yuncms/releases/tag/v0.1.28" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;YunCMS 0.1.28&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://github.com/Yunsoft-Software/yuncms/blob/main/docs/data-model.md" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Data Model&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://github.com/Yunsoft-Software/yuncms/blob/main/docs/permissions.md" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Permissions&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://github.com/Yunsoft-Software/yuncms/blob/main/docs/ai-automations.md" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;AI Automations&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://github.com/Yunsoft-Software/yuncms/blob/main/docs/mcp.md" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;MCP&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
